{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_05C0F0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"关于凤尾绿咬鹃，你想知道什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯……如果了解它的生态，寻找时也许能派上用场。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"好。首先，它的样子你应该还记得。羽毛和背部是<R= 绿色 ,VIRIDIAN>与蓝色交织成渐变般的色彩，也就是翡翠绿。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R= 绿色 ,VIRIDIAN>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":147,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"腹部是鲜艳的红色，尾羽是白色。真是种漂亮的鸟……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"另外，两根长长的装饰羽只有繁殖期的雄鸟才有。鸟类大多都是雄性更漂亮。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"和孔雀的装饰羽一样？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"对。顺便一提，它们身体大约40厘米长，但算上装饰羽，很多个体都会超过1米。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"它们常用喙在朽木上啄洞筑巢，巢一般离地面3到4米左右。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":77,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"因为是杂食性，从果实到蜥蜴，什么都吃。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"该去哪里找？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"栖息范围遍布整片热带云雾林。看来还是只能循着叫声去找。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"这样啊……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"我会学它的叫声给你听，加油！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"啾——啾——啾——……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"学得真像。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"顺便也给你学个鸡叫？喔喔喔——！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"那个……那个就不用了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"是吗？那猴子呢？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"……那个也……不用了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"……真遗憾……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""}]}